      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.91,
      "end_seconds": 315.96,
      "duration_seconds": 33.05,
      "text": "I'd like you to take prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day, for five days it's for COPD flare-up don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day please don't wait if you become more breathless or your lips turn blue that's when to be seen urgently see me again in one week can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
